# API Framework

Use FastAPI for the API layer in this project.

We chose FastAPI instead of Flask because FastAPI has stronger first-class support for async request handling and streaming responses, which fits LLM response streaming.

When adding API routes, prefer FastAPI-native patterns such as `async def` endpoints, dependency injection, Pydantic schemas, and streaming response primitives.
